1
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,600
Frozen knees from the ride.

2
00:00:20,589 --> 00:00:23,399
Cold night left outside.

3
00:00:24,539 --> 00:00:26,989
Old fears in my head.

4
00:00:27,399 --> 00:00:32,280
Empty words left unsaid.

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,079
Wax and smoke in the air.

6
00:00:36,299 --> 00:00:40,280
Bambang sits in his chair.

7
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,520
Warm tea by the floor.

8
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:48,679
Shadows wait by the door.

9
00:00:50,579 --> 00:00:53,020
Heavy doors swing wide.

10
00:00:53,590 --> 00:00:58,000
Ginger steps to my side.

11
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:01,119
Emerald silk on her chest.

12
00:01:01,399 --> 00:01:06,019
Mara wears velvet best.

13
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:12,079
A glass breaks at the bar.

14
00:01:12,299 --> 00:01:16,250
Mary screams from afar.

15
00:01:16,469 --> 00:01:19,219
Thirteen years on the shelf.

16
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:23,980
The queen reveals herself.

17
00:01:40,519 --> 00:01:44,170
Old tales of the coast.

18
00:01:44,390 --> 00:01:48,159
Champions laugh and boast.

19
00:01:48,379 --> 00:01:51,150
Ginger stands near my frame.

20
00:01:51,450 --> 00:01:56,180
Hands that whisper my name.

21
00:01:56,400 --> 00:02:00,269
"Do not think, only fly."

22
00:02:00,489 --> 00:02:03,680
Take the floor, don't ask why.

23
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:07,099
She pulls me to my feet.

24
00:02:07,299 --> 00:02:17,009
Where the lion and music meet.